<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I sense something truly horrifying.<PG>
It appears to be a world 100 years ahead―a scenario of the far future.<PG>
Could a world that far ahead truly be connected to the scenarios we have seen so far...?<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
No, that way of thinking is not good.<PG>
Droga has been made for hundreds of years, and it has had an enormous effect even on the world around Shiyo 800.<PG>
If so, a future 100 years ahead may not be so very far away.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Most likely, events more horrifying and more inexplicable than ever await us.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
But what on earth will happen... 
{PAUSE ""}
I do not even want to imagine it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日お辞儀.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
